<p class="lede">Membership is free for anyone living, working or studying in the county.</p>
<h2>What you need to bring</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Proof of address dated within the last three months</li>
  <li>Photo identification</li>
</ul>
<h2>Borrowing limits</h2>
<p>Members may borrow up to twelve items at a time, for three weeks, renewable twice.</p>
